# ESP-IDF WROOM-32 Logging physical HIL, NOT a platform-wide library default.
# Evidence 2026-10-18: at ESP-IDF's 3584-byte default the test's app_main
# measured only 448 bytes stack high-water margin after NVS/SPIFFS, Memory,
# dual-core producer, EDP-Threading coordinator, Serial and frame validation.
# That earlier G11-only fixture used 8192 B; the later complete G4
# Typed Envelope was observed exceeding 8192 B and needs its own budget.
# 2026-10-22: full 15-field G4 whole-record JSON/CBOR application HIL
# requalified with 14336 bytes and 3512 bytes high-water minimum remaining.
# This fixture stack is NOT a Logging library default or production minimum.
# A production application's Bootstrap must independently set its own budget.
CONFIG_ESP_MAIN_TASK_STACK_SIZE=14336
